+
+```text
+inspect_lora_v0.5_baseline.py
+inspect_sort_lora_v0.5_baseline.py
+test_lora_tools_v0.5_baseline.py
+```
+
+The active compatibility launchers are at the repository root. The implementation is under `src/lora_header_inspector/`.
